Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:08:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] drm/panel: add Smartisan ODIN Novatek NT36672 1080p DSI
 panel driver

Add support for the Novatek NT36672-based 1080x1920 video mode panel
found in the Smartisan ODIN.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-nt36672.c | 364 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 364 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-nt36672.c

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-nt36672.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-nt36672.c
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..17ce3fb83
